    "type": "NOTE:TNAM",
    "editor": "CrimsonCaravanNote02",
    "en": "Efforts to \"encourage\" Henry Jamison to resign have so far failed. His parents are proving stubborn as well - obviously, they don't want him around anymore than I do. Getting the New Vegas branch up and running should have been a simple job for him, but this place is still as crude and primitive as any frontier branch. Very irritating."
